  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Innovation Program (HIP Norway) 2022-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFA delegates the administration of HIP Norway to Innovation Norway. HIP Norway gives grants to develop, test and scale new technological solutions that can conribute to better and more efficient humanitarian response in ODA-eligible countries. It shall connect the needs and competencies of the humanitarian sector with technological capabilieties offered by entrepreneurs and companies and establish partnerships with private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
